  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Cursed Transmutation — Innate Technique (18th level)</em></p><p><em>Domain Expansion (rules): full-turn action, 20 CE unless stated, 175-ft radius, 1 minute. When the domain ends you suffer <strong>Technique Burnout</strong> (applied automatically by the module).</em></p><p>At 18th level you have mastered your technique allowing you to expand your domain. At initiative 20, your entire domain is affected by an <em>Areal Transmute</em> of your choice and takes effect immediately. Additionally, you can use <em>Transmute Self</em> on willing creatures within your domain.</p>",
